                                                "sense_id": "be9ae63c-eb2d-323a-b249-2b687a57c256",
                                                "text": "Della Collins Cook, a paleopathologist at Indiana University who did not participate in the study but specializes in treponemal diseases, praised the research as a “very, very interesting step” advancing understanding of syphilis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4c55e4d-40e6-4b4d-8a42-c74fcbcc0c28",
                                                "sense_id": "be9ae63c-eb2d-323a-b249-2b687a57c256",
                                                "text": "In other cases, paleopathologists have not found the actual tumors, but rather signs left by the tumors in the body."
                                            }
                                        ]
